name: sim.combineRgbImages
description: Combines two RGB images
luaSynopsis: bytes outImg = sim.combineRgbImages(bytes img1, list img1Res, bytes img2, list img2Res, int operation)
pythonSynopsis: buffer outImg = sim.combineRgbImages(buffer img1, int[2] img1Res, buffer img2, int[2] img2Res, int operation)
inputs:
1. img1: input image 1, as succession of rgb values.
2. img1Res: x/y resolution of image 1.
3. img2: input image 2, as succession of rgb values.
4. img2Res: x/y resolution of image 2.
5. operation: operation to be performed with the two input images.
outputs:
1. output image as succession of rgb values.
